---
// Cache-aside on GET /cases/{case_id}. Timings are the first round of the
// capture beside the figure: MISS 98.5 ms, then HIT 4.2 ms; TTL 30 s.
const W = 900, H = 330;
---
<figure class="bep8a">
  <div class="bep8a-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A client calls the endpoint. The endpoint asks Redis first, step 1. Only when Redis has no copy does it ask the database, step 2. A hit answers in 4.2 milliseconds, a miss in 98.5 milliseconds. The database box is outlined in red.">
    <rect x="20" y="130" width="120" height="64" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="80" y="168" text-anchor="middle" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>client</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>client</tspan></text>

    <line x1="140" y1="162" x2="258" y2="162" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="270,162 258,156 258,168" class="hd" />

    <rect x="270" y="110" width="200" height="104" rx="10" class="box" />
    <image href="/icons/flow/fastapi.svg" x="340" y="122" width="60" height="11" aria-hidden="true" />
    <text x="370" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="code">GET /cases/{'{case_id}'}</text>
    <text x="370" y="182" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>cache-aside</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cache-aside</tspan></text>
    <text x="370" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>look, then fetch, then remember</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nhìn, rồi lấy, rồi nhớ</tspan></text>

    <polyline points="470,138 560,138 560,66 650,66" class="ln" fill="none" />
    <polygon points="662,66 650,60 650,72" class="hd" />
    <text x="552" y="102" text-anchor="end" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>1 · look first</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 · hỏi trước</tspan></text>

    <polyline points="470,186 560,186 560,264 650,264" class="ln red" fill="none" />
    <polygon points="662,264 650,258 650,270" class="hd red" />
    <text x="552" y="232" text-anchor="end" class="b red"><tspan data-lang-en>2 · only on a miss</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2 · chỉ khi miss</tspan></text>

    <rect x="662" y="22" width="220" height="88" rx="10" class="box" />
    <image href="/icons/flow/mailbox.svg" x="678" y="38" width="32" height="28" aria-hidden="true" />
    <text x="722" y="58" class="h">Redis</text>
    <text x="678" y="86" class="code">case:C-1</text>
    <text x="678" y="102" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>expires after 30 s (TTL)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hết hạn sau 30 s (TTL)</tspan></text>

    <rect x="662" y="220" width="220" height="88" rx="10" class="box redbox" />
    <text x="772" y="256" text-anchor="middle" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>database (SQLite)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>database (SQLite)</tspan></text>
    <text x="772" y="280" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>the slow, shared thing</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thứ chậm, dùng chung</tspan></text>

    <text x="20" y="262" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>hit: answered from Redis</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hit: trả lời từ Redis</tspan></text>
    <text x="300" y="262" class="num">4.2 ms</text>
    <text x="20" y="296" class="b red"><tspan data-lang-en>miss: Redis, then database, then SET</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>miss: Redis, rồi database, rồi SET</tspan></text>
    <text x="300" y="296" class="num red">98.5 ms</text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>One endpoint, two paths. The first read pays for the database and leaves a copy in Redis; the next reads stop at step 1.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một endpoint, hai đường đi. Lần đọc đầu trả giá cho database rồi để lại một bản trong Redis; các lần sau dừng ở bước 1.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep8a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep8a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep8a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep8a text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep8a .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15.5px; }
  .bep8a .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep8a .b { fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep8a .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep8a .num { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep8a .num.red, .bep8a .b.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8a .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep8a .box.redbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep8a .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep8a .ln.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .bep8a .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep8a .hd.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
